---
id: honeycrisp-apple
title: Honeycrisp Apple
category: snacks

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 151

storage:
  fridge_days: 30
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Rinse @honeycrisp-apples{1} under cold water and pat dry. Eat it whole, or core it and cut it into wedges just before eating, since cut apple browns within an hour.
